Symptom: 404 errors for image paths
Causes: - Wrong relative path depth (../assets vs ../../assets) - File doesn’t exist at specified location - Case sensitivity in filenames
Solution:
# From projects/categories/*.qmd
image: "../../assets/images/logo.png"  # Up 2 levels, then down

# From projects/*.qmd  
image: "../assets/images/logo.png"     # Up 1 level, then down



Symptom: Styles in CSS file but not visible in browser
Diagnosis: 1. Check if CSS file is in _site/styles/ 2. Check browser cache (Cmd+Shift+R) 3. Check for inline styles overriding CSS 4. Check selector specificity
Solution:
# Force clean rebuild
rm -rf _site && quarto render --no-execute



Symptom: Desktop looks good, mobile is broken
Solution: Add responsive breakpoints
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .quarto-listing-default .quarto-post {
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .thumbnail {
    width: 100%;
    height: 200px;
  }
}







