## Customization Options

### Column Widths
Available classes:
- `.fig-col-1` - Full width (100%)
- `.fig-col-2` - Two columns (48% each)
- `.fig-col-3` - Three columns (31% each)
- `.fig-col-4` - Four columns (23% each)
- `.fig-col-30`, `.fig-col-40`, `.fig-col-45`, `.fig-col-50`, `.fig-col-60`, `.fig-col-70`, `.fig-col-80` - Custom widths

### Label Sizes
- `.fig-label-sm` - 12pt
- `.fig-label-md` - 14pt (default)
- `.fig-label-lg` - 16pt
- `.fig-label-xl` - 18pt

### Label Position
- `.fig-label-top` - Above image (default)
- `.fig-label-bottom` - Below image
- `.fig-label-left` - Left-aligned
- `.fig-label-center` - Center-aligned
- `.fig-label-right` - Right-aligned

### Caption Styles
- `.fig-caption` - Default (left-aligned, 90% width)
- `.fig-caption-center` - Centered caption
- `.fig-caption-sm` - Smaller text (0.8em)
- `.fig-caption-md` - Default size (0.9em)
- `.fig-caption-lg` - Larger text (1em)

